{"id":127854156536129,"name":"Rigged Obby","desc":"THIS IS NOT AN OBBY YOU WILL COMPLETE IN 10 MINUTES (probably)\nTHERE ARE A LOT OF LUCK REQUIRING STAGES IN THIS Experience AND YOU NEED PATIENCE FOR THEM\n60 fps recommended, otherwise some stages might feel bad to play (the cube running thing for example) (lower your fps cap to 60 if you're playing on anything higher)\n\nalso epilepsy warning on stages 7 14 20 and possibly also 17","path":"/game/127854156536129-rigged-obby","slug":"127854156536129-rigged-obby","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-3c0e8167acebf89c3f11d61154947573/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-9158141b524d5232c8f39290994f2f3b/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","/brand/kocakz-logo.png"],"playing":0,"visitor":339924,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-08-16T18:31:12.449Z","creator":{"name":"Very Rigged Games","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"Rigged-Obby-Auto-Beat-Game-48866","_id":"68a0ce7023e74530f456adb8","title":"Auto Beat Game","game":{"_id":"68a0ce7023e74530f456adb5","gameId":127854156536129,"name":"Rigged Obby","imageUrl":"/images/sb/rbx-9158141b524d5232c8f39290994f2f3b-2d5cf32c84cc.png","placeId":127854156536129},"features":"beats the game for u. thats all","tags":["free","keyless","op","insta","ein"],"script":"local Players = game:GetService(\"Players\")\nlocal player = Players.LocalPlayer\nlocal character = player.Character or player.CharacterAdded:Wait()\nlocal humanoidRootPart = character:WaitForChild(\"HumanoidRootPart\")\n\nlocal stagesFolder = game:GetService(\"Workspace\").Stages\n\nfor i = 1, 30 do\n\tlocal stage = stagesFolder:FindFirstChild(tostring(i))\n\tif stage then\n\t\thumanoidRootPart.CFrame = stage.CFrame + Vector3.new(0, 5, 0)\n\t\twait(0.1)\n\tend\nend\n\nsetclipboard(\"https://discord.gg/TR3quUFgT6\")","owner":{"_id":"684ed1e0f85943d0727e8335","username":"Metal","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/i